<title>FINLAND: FINNISH JAN BUILDING PERMITS VOL UP 50 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH JAN BUILDING PERMITS VOL UP 50 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The construction volume for which building permits were granted rose 50 percent year-on-year in January to 1.4 million cubic metres, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Thursday.  </p>
<p>&quot;In January, a building permit was granted for more than 1,500 new homes, which is more than double compared to the previous year,&quot; Statistics Finland said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
